  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cascade - Russian Federation (01-Jul-2021-30-Jun-2024)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Russian Federation, HIV, St. Petersburg charitable fund programs &#x201c;Humanitarian action&#x201d; (Humanitarian Action)This program has the following goals: To reduce HIV transmission and mitigate its impact on society by strengthening comprehensive responses to HIV, with a main focus on key populations. The objectives of this program are: To develop and implement exemplary comprehensive service-delivery models that strengthen the HIV Test-Treatment cascade, with a special focus on key populations.  To strengthen sustainability of these service-delivery models by investing in partnerships and improved coordination and collaboration between civil society and State service providers; as well as investments in strengthening community systems (CSS)</narrative>
  </description>
